## Choose the right layer

| Need | Use | Boundary |
| --- | --- | --- |
| A repeated visual or interaction element | [Components](../components/index.html), such as fields, cards and tables | Reuse the canonical owner and its complete examples |
| A supported device control | The domain specification below and the native control | Capability, permission, mode and range come from Home Assistant |
| A task across several controls | The flow specification below | Preserve unsaved work, native outcomes and recovery routes |
| Native shell, colour settings or Energy presentation | [Compatibility register](compatibility-register.html) | Only the listed exact adapters claim maintained integration |
| A new or third-party surface | Its native interface and documented variables | Matching colours alone do not establish behavioural support |

